{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "What Happened Last Night?"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Stressful Night"}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 13}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange information about hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le13ob04re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Stress with Suffixes: Three Syllable on the Suffix "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You stress words differently according to their <span class=\"strong\">suffix patterns</span>. The syllable stressed in the word will depend on the <span class=\"strong\">suffix pattern</span> that the word follows."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Words ending in -ee, -eer, and -ese are stressed on the<span class=\"strong\"> last syllable</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the following words and pay attention to proper emphasis and suffix stress:<br/> guaran<span class=\"strong\">tee</span><br/> emplo<span class=\"strong\">yee</span><br/> over<span class=\"strong\">see</span><br/> engin<span class=\"strong\">eer</span><br/> sights<span class=\"strong\">eer</span><br/> volunt<span class=\"strong\">eer</span><br/> Japan<span class=\"strong\">ese</span><br/> Canton<span class=\"strong\">ese</span><br/> Vietnam<span class=\"strong\">ese</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "He guaran<span class=\"strong\">teed</span> the shipment would be here at 4:00 pm."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We're short-handed three employ<span class=\"strong\">ees</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Are you with the Asian engineer committ<span class=\"strong\">ee</span>?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I need you to over<span class=\"strong\">see</span> the bar."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We have Japan<span class=\"strong\">ese</span>, Chin<span class=\"strong\">ese</span>, Vietnam<span class=\"strong\">ese</span>, Korean and Canton<span class=\"strong\">ese</span> from Hong Kong."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Would you like che<span class=\"strong\">ese</span> and crackers?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "We have two sight<span class=\"strong\">see</span>rs and I am a volun<span class=\"strong\">teer</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Are you with the Asian engin<span class=\"strong\">eer</span> committee?"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Intonation in Non-Final Thought Groups"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "A thought group refers to a coherent unit of speech that forms a whole. You normally separate a long sentence into several thought groups, held together by thematic content or by natural pauses in the sentence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Non-final thought groups represent all the thought groups that you say before the last thought group of a sentence. The final thought group is the thought group that ends a sentence.<br/> You stress non-final thought groups differently from final thought groups."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You normally stress Non-Final thought groups with a normal-rising-normal pattern.<br/> You stress final thought groups with a normal-rising-falling pattern.<br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<br/> "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll take <span class=\"strong\">car</span>e of them,/ I need you to oversee the <span class=\"strong\">bar</span>. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I <span class=\"strong\">just</span> called her on the <span class=\"strong\">pho</span>ne. She <span class=\"strong\">said</span> she's <span class=\"strong\">sick</span> / and <span class=\"strong\">can</span>'t come in."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Rachel told <span class=\"strong\">me</span> / they were in a car <span class=\"strong\">accident</span>."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Would you like <span class=\"strong\">Mer</span>lot / or <span class=\"strong\">Sauvignon</span>?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Would you like <span class=\"strong\">white</span> / or <span class=\"strong\">red</span>?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">My name is Vanessa, and I will be serving you this evening.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You normally stress Non-Final thought groups with a normal-rising-normal pattern.<br/> You stress final thought groups with a normal-rising-falling pattern.<br/>  Example:<br/>  <span class=\"italic\"> My name is Vanessa and I will be serving you this evening.<br/> &nbsp&nbsp\u2192&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp\u2192&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp\u2192&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp\u2192&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp\u2197\u2198\u2192&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp\u2192&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp\u2192&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp\u2192&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp\u2197\u2198&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp\u2192&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp\u2192&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp\u2192\u2197\u2198\u2198<br/>      My name is Van<span class=\"strong\">essa</span> / and I will be <span class=\"strong\">servi</span>ng you / this <span class=\"strong\">eve</span>ning.</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "preoccupied "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "thinking or worrying about something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Maybe they were preoccupied with other things."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le13ob04aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear when you discuss stress!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "banged up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be injured"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They are a little banged up, but ok."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le13ob04aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to help out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make it \u200bpossible or \u200beasier for someone to do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am a volunteer helping out."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le13ob04aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sightseer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who \u200bvisits \u200binteresting \u200bplaces"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have two sightseers here now."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le13ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "supplier"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a \u200bcompany or person that \u200bprovides things that \u200bpeople \u200bwant or need"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Here is the supplier."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le13ob04aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, brainstorm all the things that give people stress."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Brainstorm some stress management techniques."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose one, and make a short 3-5 minute presentation about stress and stress management."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include examples of things that make you feel stressed."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include your techniques for combating stress."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I brainstorm the different types of stress."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I brainstorm the different types of stress management."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I create a short presentation on what gives me stress."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I relay information clearly and concisely."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain techniques I use for managing stress."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le13ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le13ob04re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le13ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I talked to my supplier yesterday when he came into the restaurant.  He guaranteed the shipment would be here at 4:00 pm. When does the engineering group arrive?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marcel</span>: 8:00 p.m.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What time is it now?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marcel</span>: It is 7:45.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Have you seen Rachel?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marcel</span>: I just called her on the phone. She said she's sick and can't come in.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Really! Where are Michael and Alexander?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marcel</span>: Rachel told me they were in a car accident.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: WHAT? Why didn't they call me?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marcel</span>: I guess they were preoccupied.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Are they ok?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marcel</span>: They are a little  banged up, but ok. They are going to stay at home though as a precaution. Here comes the engineering group!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: GREAT! We're short-handed three employees.   I'll take care of them, I need you to oversee the bar.", "id": 1, "time": "50", "image": "engenn10le13ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Welcome to Bistro 88. Are you with the Asian engineer committee?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wu</span>: Yes, we are.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: And how many in your party?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wu</span>: Twenty-two. Two are late.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Come with me everyone.<br/><br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hello, everyone. My name is Vanessa and I will be serving you this evening. So where is everybody from?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wu</span>: We are from all over Asia. We have Japanese, Chinese, Vietnamese, Korean and Cantonese from Hong Kong.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, welcome to Boston. Are all of you engineers?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wu</span>: No, we have two sightseers and I am a volunteer helping out. Could we start with some of your famous Bistro wine? I'll order for everybody.", "id": 2, "time": "45500", "image": "engenn10le13ob04re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Absolutely! Would you like white or red?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wu</span>: Three bottles of white and three of red.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Would you like Merlot or Sauvignon?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wu</span>: I'd like Sauvignon, please.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Would you like cheese and crackers?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Wu</span>: Yes, please.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Great! I'll be right back.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marcel</span>: Here is the supplier.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Tell your boss he's fired!", "id": 3, "time": "90500", "image": "engenn10le13ob04re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about relationships and character traits."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can say and use words like <span class=\"italic\">employee</span>, <span class=\"italic\">engineer</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Cantonese</span>."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can use proper intonation in non-final thought groups."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What stresses you out?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What do you do to relieve your stress?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Pronunciation Spot: What stresses you out?"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " \nWe're <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">short-handed</span> so we are going to be busy tonight.\n"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}]}, {"type": "tips", "content": [{"tip_id": 0, "type": "text", "content": " The word <span class=\"italic\">\u201cshort-handed\u201d</span> means not having enough staff in a work situation."}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio."}]}], "template_over